# Memory

Query and maintain memory using the `continuous-learning` skill.

## Skill Loaded
**Required:** Read `skills/continuous-learning/SKILL.md` and `commands/memory.md`.

## Usage
```
/memory search nullable migration
/memory promote
```

## Output
Ranked matches with confidence, repos seen, and last reinforced. For `promote`: what
crossed the threshold and why.

## Notes
Ranking is confidence x recency x repo-match. Recency alone degrades as a relevance
proxy exactly as the store becomes valuable.
